new file mode 100644
index 0000000..20033f1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/notes/plan.md
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Product review implementation plan
+
+1. Tighten the review request model to accept only integer ratings 1 through 5, and keep request-only customer/product fields out of the public response shape.
+2. Replace public review customer serialization with a minimal reviewer projection containing only the reviewer’s first name, and populate the required review fields explicitly.
+3. Refactor review API status handling: set the path product id before checks, enforce authenticated customer ownership for auth POST, return 400 for invalid ratings, 409 for duplicate customer/product reviews, 403 for customer-id mismatch, and 404 for missing or cross-product merchant updates/deletes. Remove broad exception handling that overwrites intentional HTTP statuses.
+4. Make update load and mutate the existing review belonging to the URL product, allowing rating/description changes without creating a second row.
+5. Recalculate product review count and one-decimal HALF_UP average from the actual review rows after every create, update, and delete; set both aggregates to zero when no reviews remain.
+6. Ensure the v2 SKU product response maps these aggregate values, including zero values, and verify all product mapper paths that expose rating/ratingCount.
+7. Add focused tests for privacy, validation, authorization/conflict/not-found behavior, update/delete persistence, and aggregate correctness; run the relevant module tests and Maven build.
